    "description": "Input for Krea-2 Medium Turbo image generation.\n\nReuses the shared krea-2 input surface so the turbo variant stays in\nlockstep with the medium/large endpoints. Krea documents a ``low`` default\ncreativity for the turbo model, but we keep the family-wide ``medium``\ndefault for a consistent API across all krea-2 endpoints; callers who want\nKrea's turbo default can pass ``creativity=\"low\"`` explicitly."
